sequenceDiagram
  actor Human
  participant T as Translator
  participant K as Markdoc retriever
  participant B as Broker
  participant P as Primary provider
  participant R as Independent reviewer
  Human->>T: Informal request
  T->>K: Retrieve relevant approved context
  K-->>T: Documents, ADRs, conflicts
  T-->>Human: Interpretation and required questions
  Human->>B: Confirm when required
  B->>P: Provider-neutral work unit
  P-->>B: Deliverable and evidence
  B->>R: Read-only diff/deliverable review
  R-->>B: Verdict and findings
  B-->>Human: Simulated result or approval gate
